{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":23,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":false,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":910,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1889389,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":280004,"Name":"hellosassypants","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280004.jpg?_r=1412891058","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1426510725,"LastPoster":{"Id":266526,"Name":"MrsCtoB","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-266526.jpg?_r=1427840086","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":60,"Preview":{"Id":1889389,"PostDate":1426510725,"PostContent":"It's becoming real. We leave for Mexico in 30 days. I feel like I HAVE so much to do but don't kn...","Author":{"Signature":"<p><strong>N&C<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><em>April 17, 2015<\/em><\/p>\n<p>Gran Caribe Real (Cancun, Mexico)<\/p>\n<p>Including Bride & Groom: 22 guests (19 adults & 3 children)","Email":"nancysoup@att.net","IpAddress":"216.23.195.134","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1411661062,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280004.jpg?_r=1412891058","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"hellosassypants","Id":280004,"Name":"hellosassypants","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"216.23.195.134","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78911,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by hellosassypants, 16 March 2015 - 04:59 AM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1426510752,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":5,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2be05941524d18db3e5163d3d106939d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;It&#039;s becoming real. We leave for Mexico in 30 days. I feel like I HAVE so much to do but don&#039;t know where to begin.&amp;nbsp; :P&amp;nbsp;Do you brides have any advice on what you did within those 30 days??? I&#039;m just getting soooo darn excited!&amp;nbsp; :D&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1889389,"PostDate":1426510725,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>It's becoming real. We leave for Mexico in 30 days. I feel like I HAVE so much to do but don't know where to begin.\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/tongue.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':P' \/>\u00a0Do you brides have any advice on what you did within those 30 days??? I'm just getting soooo darn excited!\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><strong>N&C<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><em>April 17, 2015<\/em><\/p>\n<p>Gran Caribe Real (Cancun, Mexico)<\/p>\n<p>Including Bride & Groom: 22 guests (19 adults & 3 children)","Email":"nancysoup@att.net","IpAddress":"216.23.195.134","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1411661062,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280004.jpg?_r=1412891058","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"hellosassypants","Id":280004,"Name":"hellosassypants","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.72.41.59","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78911,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by calgarybride2015, 16 March 2015 - 05:05 AM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1426511122,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b5b3f0835e9b3940e43bd4e4f457ee2e","RawContent":"Just keep plugging away!! I had a list and just kept crossing things off.  Get your favors and gifts so you can start packing them -- if you are done with it, pack it. Makes the last week less stressful.   Remember to organize your receipts and print your wedding paperwork - I printed the odd email that had a price in it that I wanted guaranteed but since I had my bill already it wasn&#039;t really needed.  Also I made a list of what was in each suitcase and the quantities incase we did get checked at customs. \n\nMake any appointments you may need - nails, waxing, hair, etc.   Ensure you have your final dress fitting and pick up set. \n\n\nIt&#039;s just the time to tie up loose ends but the more you do now the less stress you&#039;ll feel the last week. Yay so exciting. Good luck. \n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1889390,"PostDate":1426511070,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Just keep plugging away!! I had a list and just kept crossing things off.  Get your favors and gifts so you can start packing them -- if you are done with it, pack it. Makes the last week less stressful.   Remember to organize your receipts and print your wedding paperwork - I printed the odd email that had a price in it that I wanted guaranteed but since I had my bill already it wasn't really needed.  Also I made a list of what was in each suitcase and the quantities incase we did get checked at customs. <br>\nMake any appointments you may need - nails, waxing, hair, etc.   Ensure you have your final dress fitting and pick up set. <br><br>\nIt's just the time to tie up loose ends but the more you do now the less stress you'll feel the last week. Yay so exciting. Good luck. <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399428602,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"216.84.102.233","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78911,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9ec69cf512343a8f607bf02546e6bc0a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"calgarybride2015\"] what receipts should we organize?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1889404,"PostDate":1426517545,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277873\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/277873-calgarybride2015\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">calgarybride2015<\/span><\/a> what receipts should we organize?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>58 guests plus bride and groom<br>\nCeremony: Gazebo<br>\nReception: Pool Deck","Email":"smileitseb@gmail.com","IpAddress":"50.90.104.129","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1394223869,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277044.jpg?_r=1432531828","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":241,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"smileitseb","Id":277044,"Name":"smileitseb","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"107.77.85.110","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78911,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1e67c3fe95c4a3debf1c4440883e0796","RawContent":"Make a detailed list and start checking off items. Even small things like making sure you have all your prescriptions filled to take with you or some books for reading. I packed a lot in the month before to make sure all our OOt bag stuff would fit , etc. Be mindful of things like for example I hadn&#039;t tried on my rehearsal dinner dress for awhile and did and then hated it, so now scrambling in last week to find new one. Every weekend I would make sure to finish my projects like the fans and maraca tags","Attachments":[],"Id":1889448,"PostDate":1426531759,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Make a detailed list and start checking off items. Even small things like making sure you have all your prescriptions filled to take with you or some books for reading. I packed a lot in the month before to make sure all our OOt bag stuff would fit , etc. Be mindful of things like for example I hadn't tried on my rehearsal dinner dress for awhile and did and then hated it, so now scrambling in last week to find new one. Every weekend I would make sure to finish my projects like the fans and maraca tags \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nadia.bozanich@gmail.com","IpAddress":"75.112.200.126","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1406736672,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"nadiakat17","Id":279229,"Name":"nadiakat17","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78911,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b7206771599b8d82242bd51214647ab5","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;So exciting! You&#039;re getting so close :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1889454,"PostDate":1426532328,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>So exciting! You're getting so close <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>\u00a0<br><br><span style=\"color:#808080;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">My planning thread :<\/span><\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;1\/st\/20151215\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/ec4b\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><br><br><br><br>\n\u00a0","Email":"perianjohnson@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1419437814,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1436293677","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"perianjay","Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"173.51.43.112","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78911,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"24ba4c545932177d3a64d9819e8c7c6b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;How exciting! I would say start packing now :) There are always things you&#039;ll start to realize you still need! And do a packing list, that always helps me a ton before I travel!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1889466,"PostDate":1426536287,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>How exciting! I would say start packing now <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> There are always things you'll start to realize you still need! And do a packing list, that always helps me a ton before I travel!\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia;\"><strong>MARIESAM SANCHEZ PHOTOGRAPHY<\/strong><\/span><\/span><br>\nWEBSITE: <a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.mariesamsanchez.com\">www.mariesamsanchez.com<\/a><br>\nBLOG: <a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.mariesamsanchezblog.com\">www.mariesamsanchez.com<\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.mariesamsanchez.com\/blog'>\/blog<\/a><br>\nCONTACT ME: <a  class=\"bbc_email\" href=\"mailto:mariesam.sanchez@gmail.com?subject=BDW%20Inquiry\" title=\"E-mail Link\">mariesam.sanchez@gmail.com<\/a><br><br><img src=\"http:\/\/i287.photobucket.com\/albums\/ll150\/msam007562\/063cb5c8-dbda-4822-87fe-ba3c0ebcdb7f.jpg\" alt=\"063cb5c8-dbda-4822-87fe-ba3c0ebcdb7f.jpg\">","Email":"mariesam.sanchez@gmail.com","IpAddress":"74.100.61.37","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1285954345,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232833.jpg?_r=1422091823","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":220,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MarieSamSanchezPhoto","Id":232833,"Name":"MarieSamSanchezPhoto","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"64.147.11.58","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78911,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"45448dd9c07d47743d4a0fd1f4075c0f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Congrats! &amp;nbsp;We are leaving in 71 days and I have a checklist with everything we have to do before then. &amp;nbsp;I just keep checking off as much as possible everyday. &amp;nbsp;I agree with the packing, or at least start a list of what you want to bring to make sure you have everything you need\/want!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1889484,"PostDate":1426543521,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Congrats! \u00a0We are leaving in 71 days and I have a checklist with everything we have to do before then. \u00a0I just keep checking off as much as possible everyday. \u00a0I agree with the packing, or at least start a list of what you want to bring to make sure you have everything you need\/want!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sabrabenes@gmail.com","IpAddress":"64.147.11.58","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1403208876,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278603.jpg?_r=1405559586","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Sabes44","Id":278603,"Name":"Sabes44","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"173.15.8.25","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78911,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c3bb056136fc3d29e4d8440d7c45c09d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Were leaving in 40! :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1889489,"PostDate":1426546202,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Were leaving in 40! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>70 Guests + Bride and Groom!","Email":"yasminea84@gmail.com","IpAddress":"173.15.8.25","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1410281845,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279750.jpg?_r=1431187157","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"yasminea84","Id":279750,"Name":"yasminea84","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.72.41.59","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78911,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c3e687e7342b57f9efce7ae6a64f88da","RawContent":"Immunizations was one I left way to last minute! If you need any. \n\n\nFor receipts I had two envelopes. One for OOT items and one for decorations incase customs stopped me I could prove their cost. The wedding documents could prove it was for a wedding :)\n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1889499,"PostDate":1426547695,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Immunizations was one I left way to last minute! If you need any. <br><br>\nFor receipts I had two envelopes. One for OOT items and one for decorations incase customs stopped me I could prove their cost. The wedding documents could prove it was for a wedding <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399428602,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"216.23.195.134","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78911,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"57d5f900630541052e0e2b82900ab05f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Sweet, check lists. I LOOOOOOVE doing a check list. LOL.&amp;nbsp; :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1889669,"PostDate":1426604782,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Sweet, check lists. I LOOOOOOVE doing a check list. LOL.\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><strong>N&C<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><em>April 17, 2015<\/em><\/p>\n<p>Gran Caribe Real (Cancun, Mexico)<\/p>\n<p>Including Bride & Groom: 22 guests (19 adults & 3 children)","Email":"nancysoup@att.net","IpAddress":"216.23.195.134","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1411661062,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280004.jpg?_r=1412891058","Phot