{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":5,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":false,"HasAttachments":true,"Views":303,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1881984,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":276518,"Name":"LauraM","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276518.jpg?_r=1394639305","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1420562385,"LastPoster":{"Id":278120,"Name":"LisaAnthonyPoppy","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278120.jpg?_r=1421810202","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":60,"Preview":{"Id":1881984,"PostDate":1420562385,"PostContent":"How are you customizing your wedding vows\/ ceremony? We've seen the sand ceremony\/water ceremony\/...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lauramthistle@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.34.236.241","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1391620956,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276518.jpg?_r=1394639305","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LauraM","Id":276518,"Name":"LauraM","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.34.236.241","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78552,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"046efe73a1a5a0373c8d5be150442d05","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;How are you customizing your wedding vows\/ ceremony? We&#039;ve seen the sand ceremony\/water ceremony\/wine ceremony time and time again. Any other ideas? We&#039;re curious about how it&#039;ll play out of we ask our DW officiant to include a Celtic Oathing Stone ceremony with out tradition vows. We would send the wedding planner the script in advance and hope everything goes smoothly but we&#039;re a little concerned there could be a lot of confusion. Anyone else doing or done something unique at their DW? How&#039;d it work out?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;(if you&#039;re not familiar with the celtic oathing ceremony...&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(51,0,0);font-family:Verdana;font-size:13px;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;this is what is read at the ceremony;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(51,0,0);font-family:Verdana;font-size:13px;\"&gt;\" mr and ms will now say their wedding vows to each other using the Celtic tradition of the oathing stone. For those of you not familiar with this tradition, it originated in Scotland and is when the bride and groom hold their hands together on a stone as they repeat their wedding vows. An oath given near a stone or water was considered to be more binding.&amp;nbsp;\n\n\n(vows are said here with couple holding the stone together.)&lt;\/span&gt;\n\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(51,0,0);font-family:Verdana;font-size:13px;\"&gt;Above you are the stars, below you are the stones.&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(51,0,0);font-family:Verdana;font-size:13px;\"&gt;As time passes, remember...&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(51,0,0);font-family:Verdana;font-size:13px;\"&gt;Like a star should your love be constant,&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(51,0,0);font-family:Verdana;font-size:13px;\"&gt;Like the earth should your love be firm.&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(51,0,0);font-family:Verdana;font-size:13px;\"&gt;Let the powers of the mind and of the intellect&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(51,0,0);font-family:Verdana;font-size:13px;\"&gt;guide you in your marriage,&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(51,0,0);font-family:Verdana;font-size:13px;\"&gt;Let the strength of your wills bind you together,&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(51,0,0);font-family:Verdana;font-size:13px;\"&gt;Let the power of love and desire make you happy&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(51,0,0);font-family:Verdana;font-size:13px;\"&gt;and the strength of your dedication make you inseparable.&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(51,0,0);font-family:Verdana;font-size:13px;\"&gt;Possess one another, yet be understanding.&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(51,0,0);font-family:Verdana;font-size:13px;\"&gt;Have patience with each other,&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(51,0,0);font-family:Verdana;font-size:13px;\"&gt;For storms will come, and they will go quickly,&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(51,0,0);font-family:Verdana;font-size:13px;\"&gt;Forced to dissipate in the light of your love.&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(51,0,0);font-family:Verdana;font-size:13px;\"&gt;Be free in giving of affection and of warmth.&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(51,0,0);font-family:Verdana;font-size:13px;\"&gt;Have no fear, and let not the ways&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(51,0,0);font-family:Verdana;font-size:13px;\"&gt;Or words of the unenlightened give you unease.&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(51,0,0);font-family:Verdana;font-size:13px;\"&gt;For your love is with you,&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(51,0,0);font-family:Verdana;font-size:13px;\"&gt;Now and always\"&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1881984,"PostDate":1420562385,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>How are you customizing your wedding vows\/ ceremony? We've seen the sand ceremony\/water ceremony\/wine ceremony time and time again. Any other ideas? We're curious about how it'll play out of we ask our DW officiant to include a Celtic Oathing Stone ceremony with out tradition vows. We would send the wedding planner the script in advance and hope everything goes smoothly but we're a little concerned there could be a lot of confusion. Anyone else doing or done something unique at their DW? How'd it work out?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>(if you're not familiar with the celtic oathing ceremony...\u00a0<span  style=\"color:rgb(51,0,0);font-family:Verdana;font-size:13px\">\u00a0this is what is read at the ceremony;<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"color:rgb(51,0,0);font-family:Verdana;font-size:13px\">\" mr and ms will now say their wedding vows to each other using the Celtic tradition of the oathing stone. For those of you not familiar with this tradition, it originated in Scotland and is when the bride and groom hold their hands together on a stone as they repeat their wedding vows. An oath given near a stone or water was considered to be more binding.\u00a0<br><br>\n(vows are said here with couple holding the stone together.)<\/span><br><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(51,0,0);font-family:Verdana;font-size:13px\">Above you are the stars, below you are the stones.<\/span><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(51,0,0);font-family:Verdana;font-size:13px\">As time passes, remember...<\/span><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(51,0,0);font-family:Verdana;font-size:13px\">Like a star should your love be constant,<\/span><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(51,0,0);font-family:Verdana;font-size:13px\">Like the earth should your love be firm.<\/span><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(51,0,0);font-family:Verdana;font-size:13px\">Let the powers of the mind and of the intellect<\/span><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(51,0,0);font-family:Verdana;font-size:13px\">guide you in your marriage,<\/span><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(51,0,0);font-family:Verdana;font-size:13px\">Let the strength of your wills bind you together,<\/span><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(51,0,0);font-family:Verdana;font-size:13px\">Let the power of love and desire make you happy<\/span><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(51,0,0);font-family:Verdana;font-size:13px\">and the strength of your dedication make you inseparable.<\/span><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(51,0,0);font-family:Verdana;font-size:13px\">Possess one another, yet be understanding.<\/span><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(51,0,0);font-family:Verdana;font-size:13px\">Have patience with each other,<\/span><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(51,0,0);font-family:Verdana;font-size:13px\">For storms will come, and they will go quickly,<\/span><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(51,0,0);font-family:Verdana;font-size:13px\">Forced to dissipate in the light of your love.<\/span><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(51,0,0);font-family:Verdana;font-size:13px\">Be free in giving of affection and of warmth.<\/span><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(51,0,0);font-family:Verdana;font-size:13px\">Have no fear, and let not the ways<\/span><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(51,0,0);font-family:Verdana;font-size:13px\">Or words of the unenlightened give you unease.<\/span><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(51,0,0);font-family:Verdana;font-size:13px\">For your love is with you,<\/span><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(51,0,0);font-family:Verdana;font-size:13px\">Now and always\"<\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lauramthistle@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.34.236.241","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1391620956,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276518.jpg?_r=1394639305","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LauraM","Id":276518,"Name":"LauraM","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.246.139.68","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78552,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3350c94eacf20e97bcda4160646f91f8","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;We did the lasso\/rosary ceremony along with all the other traditional things and it worked out great. &amp;nbsp;We were able to meet with the minister the day before the wedding and spoke to him about the tone we wanted for the ceremony and gave him something to read and he made some notes on it and made it his own. &amp;nbsp;It worked out great and it was very special and our guests loved it. &amp;nbsp;It made for some nice pics as well. &amp;nbsp;Its definitely a nice touch to add your own special traditions to your ceremony. &amp;nbsp;Another plus is now we have this beautiful rosary that will always be in our family and can be passed down to our kids. I&#039;m all for making your ceremony your own.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1881990,"PostDate":1420565278,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>We did the lasso\/rosary ceremony along with all the other traditional things and it worked out great. \u00a0We were able to meet with the minister the day before the wedding and spoke to him about the tone we wanted for the ceremony and gave him something to read and he made some notes on it and made it his own. \u00a0It worked out great and it was very special and our guests loved it. \u00a0It made for some nice pics as well. \u00a0Its definitely a nice touch to add your own special traditions to your ceremony. \u00a0Another plus is now we have this beautiful rosary that will always be in our family and can be passed down to our kids. I'm all for making your ceremony your own.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1881990]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_01_2015\/post-264077-0-77680000-1420565091.jpg\" title=\"10750340_10100617471309537_3661280222175259044_o.jpg - Size: 81.73KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_01_2015\/post-264077-0-77680000-1420565091.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"10750340_10100617471309537_3661280222175259044_o.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1881990]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_01_2015\/post-264077-0-65744400-1420565089.jpg\" title=\"10644156_10100617471484187_2116126913837642922_o.jpg - Size: 60.68KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_01_2015\/post-264077-0-65744400-1420565089.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"10644156_10100617471484187_2116126913837642922_o.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1881990]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_01_2015\/post-264077-0-39953900-1420565087.jpg\" title=\"10553845_10100617471663827_124923507883077188_o.jpg - Size: 38.95KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_01_2015\/post-264077-0-39953900-1420565087.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"10553845_10100617471663827_124923507883077188_o.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div>\n<p>43 guests plus bride and groom.... <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Engagement Photos - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76051-engagement-pictures-by-del-sol-photography-pic-heavy\/#entry1827276'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76051-engagement-pictures-by-del-sol-photography-pic-heavy\/#entry1827276<\/a><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77563-njbride2014-planning-thread-leblanc-spa-resort-91314-pic-heavy\/#entry1860630'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77563-njbride2014-planning-thread-leblanc-spa-resort-91314-pic-heavy\/#entry1860630<\/a>","Email":"sandyycaza@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"66.246.139.68","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1357674861,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-264077.jpg?_r=1415048239","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"NJBride2014","Id":264077,"Name":"NJBride2014","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"208.87.237.180","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78552,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"acca28bb8ec4615beb4925ddddec0589","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I can&#039;t see that you would have an issue. I would think the officiants in Mexico are probably used to getting requests for things \"off the beaten path\". The Celtic ceremony sounds nice. My favourite is the handfasting.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1881997,"PostDate":1420566284,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I can't see that you would have an issue. I would think the officiants in Mexico are probably used to getting requests for things \"off the beaten path\". The Celtic ceremony sounds nice. My favourite is the handfasting.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><em>I said \"yes\" again to the love of my life at Grand Coral Beach Club, Playa del Carmen, Mexico on our 4th anniversary - October 20, 2015<\/em><\/span>","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283458999,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.34.236.241","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78552,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"93c5c3978e86a14bbd50e7255bab2d3f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"NJBride2014\"] That is Beautiful! Thank you for sharing.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1882025,"PostDate":1420573911,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"264077\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/264077-njbride2014\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">NJBride2014<\/span><\/a> That is Beautiful! Thank you for sharing.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lauramthistle@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.34.236.241","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1391620956,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276518.jpg?_r=1394639305","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LauraM","Id":276518,"Name":"LauraM","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"74.139.45.237","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78552,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"abb515b8fd5dda8aa6bc1805413cd9ea","RawContent":"We are doing a traditional ceremony but seating is circle of love, we are having family\/friends pass rings for blessing, hand on heart for exchange of vowels. \n\n\nWe kindly rejected any idea of a sand ceremony. \n\n\nI would have liked to have a partial Greek Orthodox wedding, will miss out on my crowns, it&#039;s ok though :\/","Attachments":[],"Id":1882092,"PostDate":1420637100,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We are doing a traditional ceremony but seating is circle of love, we are having family\/friends pass rings for blessing, hand on heart for exchange of vowels. <br><br>\nWe kindly rejected any idea of a sand ceremony. <br><br>\nI would have liked to have a partial Greek Orthodox wedding, will miss out on my crowns, it's ok though :\/ \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lisananth@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"166.137.101.169","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1401136433,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278120.jpg?_r=1421810202","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LisaAnthonyPoppy","Id":278120,"Name":"LisaAnthonyPoppy","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"78552","Title":"Adding A Special Ceremony To A Traditional Ceremony","LastPostDate":1420637100},"Pages":{"TotalItems":5,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
