Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":12,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":false,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":728,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1864652,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":276833,"Name":"peachykeen159","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1407264772,"LastPoster":{"Id":281097,"Name":"Jamaica2016","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":60,"Preview":{"Id":1864652,"PostDate":1407264772,"PostContent":"Hello,\u00a0 \u00a0 Did you ask your bridesmaids before or after they had RSVP'd? I feel like if you ask be...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"penjani@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"71.17.38.13","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1393175102,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"peachykeen159","Id":276833,"Name":"peachykeen159","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.17.38.13","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77730,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e4ae012afd6b6380ecafd81b16a64169","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hello,&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Did you ask your bridesmaids before or after they had RSVP&#039;d? I feel like if you ask before, there is that pressure for them to go but if you do it after then you know if they were planning on coming anyways and it makes it easier to pick from your friends already coming. I have had a couple of people tell me it would be better to ask before because friends who assumed they would be bridesmaids might get offended when invitations go out and they haven&#039;t been asked yet.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1864652,"PostDate":1407264772,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello,\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Did you ask your bridesmaids before or after they had RSVP'd? I feel like if you ask before, there is that pressure for them to go but if you do it after then you know if they were planning on coming anyways and it makes it easier to pick from your friends already coming. I have had a couple of people tell me it would be better to ask before because friends who assumed they would be bridesmaids might get offended when invitations go out and they haven't been asked yet.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"penjani@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"71.17.38.13","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1393175102,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"peachykeen159","Id":276833,"Name":"peachykeen159","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.72.208.82","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77730,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"20125201d05fea03673915cc9204dbb8","RawContent":"I asked before but had thrown the idea of a DW to them before hand and knew they were coming. I did however not ask my flower girl before RSVP came in since I didn&#039;t want to pressure our friend\/family to bring their children and the added expense of doing so. I waited until RSVP was in and knew they were bringing their child before asking flower girl. All others in party knew before hand.","Attachments":[],"Id":1864653,"PostDate":1407265143,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I asked before but had thrown the idea of a DW to them before hand and knew they were coming. I did however not ask my flower girl before RSVP came in since I didn't want to pressure our friend\/family to bring their children and the added expense of doing so. I waited until RSVP was in and knew they were bringing their child before asking flower girl. All others in party knew before hand. \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kmkwedding2016@gmail.com","IpAddress":"70.72.195.234","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1390256608,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"kmk2016","Id":276231,"Name":"kmk2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"184.151.118.119","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77730,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by calgarybride2015, 05 August 2014 - 11:54 AM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1407268484,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8b293a9f3745b710133a450dc4ab294d","RawContent":"I did it after because I didn&#039;t want anyone to feel pressure! I didn&#039;t wait until deposits were paid though. Once I threw out that we were having a DW and and knew they&#039;d come I asked. \n\n\nBut unless you wait until they pay you may find some still don&#039;t come. \n\n\nSo many ways to do it\n\n\nEdit. I didn&#039;t have anyone who assumed they would. Well not sure?? Haha. One I would have asked straight out RSVP or not but she hasn&#039;t talked to me since I got engaged so that solved that. Sigh :(\n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1864663,"PostDate":1407267134,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I did it after because I didn't want anyone to feel pressure! I didn't wait until deposits were paid though. Once I threw out that we were having a DW and and knew they'd come I asked. <br><br>\nBut unless you wait until they pay you may find some still don't come. <br><br>\nSo many ways to do it<br><br>\nEdit. I didn't have anyone who assumed they would. Well not sure?? Haha. One I would have asked straight out RSVP or not but she hasn't talked to me since I got engaged so that solved that. Sigh <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/><br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399428602,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.112.200.126","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77730,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3c1b9d7e6c3ab2c6d297bee8367029ac","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;We are still undecided if we want to have more than just our siblings (who obviously are coming)- the only other person I asked was my best friend bc I knew she was definitely coming. I was waiting to decide who for sure was coming before asking more (for example, one of my good friends doesn&#039;t know if her husband will still have his job in a few months so not sure if they will have funds for the trip). I actually had one friend that I had considered asking tell me there is no way she will be able to make it a few months after I announced where we were getting married- so I struggle a bit that maybe if I had asked her before, she would have made more of an effort to come? But then I wouldn&#039;t want to rope people into coming. I think in the end it might just be easier to have the people I listed above (best friend and siblings) so we don&#039;t feel pressured to figure out bridesmaid dresses and things like that more last minute when people actually have to RSVP&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1864695,"PostDate":1407275434,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>We are still undecided if we want to have more than just our siblings (who obviously are coming)- the only other person I asked was my best friend bc I knew she was definitely coming. I was waiting to decide who for sure was coming before asking more (for example, one of my good friends doesn't know if her husband will still have his job in a few months so not sure if they will have funds for the trip). I actually had one friend that I had considered asking tell me there is no way she will be able to make it a few months after I announced where we were getting married- so I struggle a bit that maybe if I had asked her before, she would have made more of an effort to come? But then I wouldn't want to rope people into coming. I think in the end it might just be easier to have the people I listed above (best friend and siblings) so we don't feel pressured to figure out bridesmaid dresses and things like that more last minute when people actually have to RSVP<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nadia.bozanich@gmail.com","IpAddress":"75.112.200.126","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1406736672,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"nadiakat17","Id":279229,"Name":"nadiakat17","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.119.162.30","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77730,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cce1c521e24e3da0e18bd58dce2cc569","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;We asked before, but to people we thought were coming for sure. But my MOH is now pregnant and probably not coming, so I&#039;m not sure if I&#039;m going to have someone fill in to even the numbers or if we just leave it&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1864697,"PostDate":1407277931,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>We asked before, but to people we thought were coming for sure. But my MOH is now pregnant and probably not coming, so I'm not sure if I'm going to have someone fill in to even the numbers or if we just leave it<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Married December 19, 2014 at Beach Palace Resort in Cancun, Mexico<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My Planning Thread - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My Wedding Review<\/p>\n<p>Part 1 - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881197'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881197<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Part 2 - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881590'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881590<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Part 3 - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881861'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881861<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"lilyluu83@gmail.com","IpAddress":"174.119.162.30","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1395609348,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277296.jpg?_r=1421643766","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"tygrrlily","Id":277296,"Name":"tygrrlily","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"23.16.108.59","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77730,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"84374a5d93184165355994730e3cb43f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;I did it after as well because I didn&#039;t want to pressure to come to our wedding just because I asked them to be the BMs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1864701,"PostDate":1407278672,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">I did it after as well because I didn't want to pressure to come to our wedding just because I asked them to be the BMs.\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Our Awesome <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.wevideo.com\/hub\/#media\/ci\/113639543'>Video<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Our <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/itslegendary2014.wix.com\/fasa'>Website<\/a><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76802-elsas-arthurs-wedding-rprm-20141208\/'>Riu Palace Riviera Maya Planning Thread<\/a><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76802-elsas-arthurs-wedding-rprm-20141208\/?p=1864158'>Pre-wedding photos<\/a>,\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76802-elsas-arthurs-wedding-rprm-20141208\/?p=1905375'>Pre-wedding photos Part II<\/a>,\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76802-elsas-arthurs-wedding-rprm-20141208\/?p=1878020'>OOT Baskets<\/a>, <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76802-elsas-arthurs-wedding-rprm-20141208\/?p=1878578'>Centrepieces<\/a><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76802-elsas-arthurs-wedding-rprm-20141208\/?p=1852686'>DIY - Giant Crepe Roses<\/a>,\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76802-elsas-arthurs-wedding-rprm-20141208\/?p=1867378'>DIY - Hangers & Boutonnieres<\/a>,\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76802-elsas-arthurs-wedding-rprm-20141208\/?p=1867696'>DIY - Kissing Menu\/I Spy & Guestbook<\/a><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76802-elsas-arthurs-wedding-rprm-20141208\/page-6#entry1878023'>More DIYs - Passport to Riviera Maya, Bookmarks, Tumbler Inserts, Luggage Tags, Keycard Holder Inserts, Something Special for You Inserts<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"elsa_jam@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"23.16.109.98","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1372287918,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270962.png?_r=1397000926","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Icis","Id":270962,"Name":"Icis","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.177.38.169","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77730,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fc1ef474ee77d608dba3e60ad5629320","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I asked before RSVP&#039;s but we knew we were having a destination wedding soon after we got engaged and spread the word. Luckily, all the BMs that I asked expressed interest from the beginning, before knowing they would be in the bridal party. I made it very clear to all that there would be no hard feelings if they couldn&#039;t attend. Eventually, deposits for rooms are due anyway so you will ultimately know who is definitely going&amp;nbsp;at that point.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1864702,"PostDate":1407279223,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I asked before RSVP's but we knew we were having a destination wedding soon after we got engaged and spread the word. Luckily, all the BMs that I asked expressed interest from the beginning, before knowing they would be in the bridal party. I made it very clear to all that there would be no hard feelings if they couldn't attend. Eventually, deposits for rooms are due anyway so you will ultimately know who is definitely going\u00a0at that point.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><\/div>\n<div><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;0;6\/st\/20150314\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/c1c3\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/div>\n<div><\/a><\/div>\n","Email":"tiffmedeiros@gmail.com","IpAddress":"50.177.38.169","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1361737826,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-266526.jpg?_r=1427840086","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MrsCtoB","Id":266526,"Name":"MrsCtoB","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"12.94.125.70","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77730,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f3cd639b87a90180ebc7c8627e68847f","RawContent":"I don&#039;t think I&#039;m going to have a wedding party but if I do, I will be asking after the deposit date","Attachments":[],"Id":1864969,"PostDate":1407418925,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I don't think I'm going to have a wedding party but if I do, I will be asking after the deposit date \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"malyna@gmail.com","IpAddress":"71.235.105.205","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1397440022,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277580.jpg?_r=1397779480","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"malyna","Id":277580,"Name":"malyna","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.17.38.13","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77730,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8afa0e933d698ed9850279eabe802421","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Thanks for the advice ladies!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1865572,"PostDate":1407733001,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Thanks for the advice ladies!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"penjani@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"71.17.38.13","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1393175102,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"peachykeen159","Id":276833,"Name":"peachykeen159","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"108.35.40.254","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77730,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"95c1a9fbbf07df39c2d12a34e6aaa984","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Most of my friends know that a DW is a go... and they still are asking about being BM. I just feel it&#039;s unfair to them to ask them to not only cough up the money for a DW but also for a BM dress. I mentioned that to them, and some of them got surprisingly hurt that I thought about not having BMs. So now I&#039;m not sure.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1866380,"PostDate":1408039412,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Most of my friends know that a DW is a go... and they still are asking about being BM. I just feel it's unfair to them to ask them to not only cough up the money for a DW but also for a BM dress. I mentioned that to them, and some of them got surprisingly hurt that I thought about not having BMs. So now I'm not sure.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"wonderlandgrl3@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"75.99.50.82","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1407874186,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279411.jpg?_r=1408152053","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Mangosong","Id":279411,"Name":"Mangosong","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"77730","Title":"To Ask Bridesmaids Before Or After Rsvp","LastPostDate":1415903561},"Pages":{"TotalItems":12,"TotalPages":2,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":10,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":10},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
