Request Time: 1 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"98.110.21.125","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77730,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cb287b488837f1ea4c2e434666f24604","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I asked my best friends and sister to be in the wedding before I sent out the invitations. &amp;nbsp; I even asked them all if doing a destination wedding would be possible for everyone before I event made it definite. &amp;nbsp;There just were some people I couldn&#039;t get married without being there. &amp;nbsp;I asked my friends over our celebration of my engagement dinner. &amp;nbsp;I made each girl a box with all sorts of things inside representing our friendship. &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1868866,"PostDate":1409002536,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I asked my best friends and sister to be in the wedding before I sent out the invitations. \u00a0 I even asked them all if doing a destination wedding would be possible for everyone before I event made it definite. \u00a0There just were some people I couldn't get married without being there. \u00a0I asked my friends over our celebration of my engagement dinner. \u00a0I made each girl a box with all sorts of things inside representing our friendship. \u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nicki7985@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"96.235.184.26","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1405901052,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279097.jpg?_r=1408764462","PhotoWidth":169,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"NickiLynn1116","Id":279097,"Name":"NickiLynn1116","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"72.213.47.20","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77730,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fd664964debd62b9a5441d24efeda478","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;This is a tough one! I would ask before, but also let them know that there is no pressure to attend!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I have one best friend that I know is attending and will be a bridesmaid and another that I am not sure will be able to make it. If she is unable to attend the wedding, she will play a major role in our reception when we return! This way she still gets to play a &#039;bridesmaid&#039; role and be by my side.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1878324,"PostDate":1415903561,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>This is a tough one! I would ask before, but also let them know that there is no pressure to attend!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I have one best friend that I know is attending and will be a bridesmaid and another that I am not sure will be able to make it. If she is unable to attend the wedding, she will play a major role in our reception when we return! This way she still gets to play a 'bridesmaid' role and be by my side.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"aricalizx3@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"72.213.47.20","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1415720684,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Jamaica2016","Id":281097,"Name":"Jamaica2016","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":12,"TotalPages":2,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":10},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
